##RenderMan RIB-Structure 1.1
##Scene Two grey spheres on a grey floor, each lit by its own light: the warm light is off for the right sphere, the cool for the left
version 3.03
Format 64 64 1
PixelSamples 8 8
Projection "perspective" "fov" [40]
Clipping 0.01 100
Translate 0 0 5
Rotate -30 1 0 0
WorldBegin
TransformBegin
Translate -0.9 0.3 -0.3
Scale 0.2 0.2 0.2
Light "PxrSphereLight" "warm" "float intensity" [80] "color lightColor" [1 0.6 0.3]
TransformEnd
TransformBegin
Translate 0.9 0.3 -0.3
Scale 0.2 0.2 0.2
Light "PxrSphereLight" "cool" "float intensity" [80] "color lightColor" [0.3 0.6 1]
TransformEnd
Color [0.6 0.6 0.6]
Surface "matte"
Polygon "P" [-2 -1 -2  2 -1 -2  2 -1 2  -2 -1 2]
AttributeBegin
Illuminate "cool" 0
Translate -0.7 -0.6 0
Sphere 0.4 -0.4 0.4 360
AttributeEnd
AttributeBegin
Illuminate "warm" 0
Translate 0.7 -0.6 0
Sphere 0.4 -0.4 0.4 360
AttributeEnd
WorldEnd
